# Secrets

| Path | Use |
|------|-----|
| `.cursor/secrets/integrations/jira.env` | `ATLASSIAN_EMAIL`, `ATLASSIAN_API_TOKEN`, `JIRA_SITE` for attachment download |
| `.cursor/secrets/local/` | Project-specific env files |

Never @-attach `secrets/` in Cursor. Never commit secrets. Redact in chat and Jira.
